      "writtenOn": "2024-08-15T18:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: double negatives could potentially be confusing. If one were to only see this definition `MESSAGE_TYPE_NONE`, the initial reaction would be that we don\u0027t want any messages, but then to see it assigned to the field `excludedMessageTypes \u003d MESSAGE_TYPE_NONE`, one would need to see a double negative to realize we\u0027re actually asking for all message types.\n\nPerhaps rename it something like `NO_MESSAGE_TYPES_EXCLUDED`?",
